<h2 id="editorial-independence">Editorial independence</h2>
<p>Listings are not for sale. A server appears in this directory, in a
category, and in a given position because of what the data says — never
because of a commercial relationship.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Sponsored placements are always labeled.</strong> The label is
  built into the component that renders them; a sponsored placement cannot be
  displayed without its disclosure.</li>
  <li><strong>Sponsorship buys placement, nothing else.</strong> It does not
  change a server's category, its position in any list, its metadata, or
  whether it is listed at all.</li>
  <li><strong>Review status is earned, not purchased.</strong> The reviewed
  badge is set only by manual editorial review. No automated process and no
  commercial arrangement can grant it.</li>
  <li><strong>Our summaries are independent.</strong> Where we publish our own
  summary of a server, it is written in-house and is unaffected by
  sponsorship. A summary is not a security review.</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Licensing, corrections, and takedowns:</strong>
email <a href="mailto:licensing@mcpjunction.ai">licensing@mcpjunction.ai</a>.
Correction and takedown requests are acknowledged within 3 business days.</p>
<p>These terms may change as the site matures; the version at /license.xml is
authoritative at time of access.</p>
